repo,Docs/02-Roadmap.md,39,36,"CodeUpdate-0037 combines the 0036B continuity cleanup package with the 0037 Software Design Specification package. It adds draft planning documents under `Docs/SDS/` and repairs stale continuity. It does not implement gameplay, networking, editor behavior, or data rewrites."
