repo,Librarium/RuntimeTraceExecution/runtime_trace_observations_0081.json,12,timer.hertz;36,"      ""conclusion"": ""MBBSEmu uses a Timer.Hertz gate when idle; default Timer.Hertz resolves to 36 if unset/invalid. WaitForNextTick returns immediately when sessions have pending inbound/outbound/process data, so busy conditions are event-driven rather than purely fixed-frequency."","
