repo,Librarium/RuntimeTraceExecution/runtime_trace_observations_0081.json,25,rtkick;begin_polling;rtihdlr;syscyc;initask,"      ""conclusion"": ""Host-visible callback surfaces are confirmed in MBBSEmu: STTROU, STSROU, BEGIN_POLLING, RTKICK, RTIHDLR, SYSCYC, INITASK. Which of these the original MajorMUD module registers still requires module-specific trace or binary evidence."","
repo,Librarium/RuntimeTraceExecution/runtime_trace_observations_0081.json,27,rtkick;begin_polling;rtihdlr;syscyc,"        ""MBBSEmu/HostProcess/ExportedModules/Ordinals.cs ordinals include BEGIN_POLLING, RTIHDLR, RTKICK, SYSCYC"","
repo,Librarium/RuntimeTraceExecution/runtime_trace_observations_0081.json,37,rtkick;rtihdlr;syscyc,"      ""conclusion"": ""In the MBBSEmu worker loop, per-session processing completes before timed/real-time events. After sessions are processed, host order is ProcessRTKICK, then ProcessRTIHDLR, then ProcessSYSCYC, then ProcessTasks. RTIHDLR itself is gated to roughly 55ms elapsed."","
repo,Librarium/RuntimeTraceExecution/runtime_trace_observations_0081.json,39,rtkick;rtihdlr;syscyc,"        ""MBBSEmu/HostProcess/MbbsHost.cs WorkerThread calls ProcessRTKICK(); ProcessRTIHDLR(); ProcessSYSCYC(); ProcessTasks(); in that order"","
