repo,Reports/Validation0006/VALIDATION0006_REPORT.md,17,rtkick,### RTKICK is engine-documentation verified
repo,Reports/Validation0006/VALIDATION0006_REPORT.md,18,rtkick,"MBBSEmu models RTKICK as a delayed one-shot real-time routine. The routine begins counting when created, fires after its delay in seconds, then is marked executed and removed. MajorMUD contains many RTKICK references, which supports the model that the module uses host-delayed scheduling."
