repo,Validation/DataSimVer0005/RoomObjectClues.csv,398,36,"wcc_map1_room2936,1,2936,Darkwood Forest,,tree,""Darkwood Forest This gloomy, unsettling forest is beautiful in a dark sort of way. The trees are black as coal, and are very tall. Their thick, knotted branches twist every which way so that they appear to be contorted in pain, though this is surely not the case. The leaves are a dark green, and are nearly as thick as "",none"
repo,Validation/DataSimVer0005/RoomObjectClues.csv,431,36,"wcc_map1_room3336,1,3336,Bank Vault,key_or_lock_text,door|gate|sign,""Bank Vault This is a large iron room. The gate here is triply locked, with a large steel door leading to the south. A sign in front of the door reads """"Silvermere Vault"""". Perhaps the untold fortunes of the city elite can be found within. It would be impossible to say for any, but the most skilled in skullduggery, would "",none"
repo,Validation/DataSimVer0005/RoomObjectClues.csv,463,36,"wcc_map2_room2536,2,2536,Dark Alley,,wall,""Dark Alley This rancid alleyway is claustrophobic and unsettling. Trash is ankle- deep on the ground, and occasionally something squishy and wet can be felt underfoot. Bloodstains are frequent on the crumbling walls, adding a certain je-ne-sais-quoi to this fine place. The tall stone barrier surrounding the city stands"",none"
repo,Validation/DataSimVer0005/RoomObjectClues.csv,528,36,"wcc_map6_room136,6,136,Swampside Path,special_text,path|pool,""Swampside Path Mud and trodden grass form the packed surface of this winding path. It skirts around the southern edge of the swamp, far enough from it as to be safe, but not far enough to escape the foul odour. The swamp lies in a bowl-like depression, but here it is impossible to enter due to dense, thorny vegetation "",none"
repo,Validation/DataSimVer0005/RoomObjectClues.csv,532,36,"wcc_map6_room236,6,236,Swampside Path,special_text,path|pool,""Swampside Path Mud and trodden grass form the packed surface of this winding path. It skirts around the northern edge of the swamp, far enough from it as to be safe, but not far enough to escape the foul odour. The swamp lies in a bowl-like depression, but here it is impossible to enter due to dense, thorny vegetation "",none"
