repo,Validation/DataSimVer0005/RoomObjectClues.csv,920,36,"wcc_map17_room636,17,636,""Blackwood Forest, Winding Trail"",,tree,""Blackwood Forest, Winding Trail This trail leads through a dark forest, thick with trees and brush. Snow weighs down the branches and occasionally falls in clumps to the ground as the wind shifts. There is an abnormal chill that reaches deep into your bones as you travel through here. Despite the snow, a faint stench"",none"
