repo,Validation/DataSimVer0005/RoomObjectClues.csv,978,3000,"wcc_map17_room3000,17,3000,Grand Hallway,key_or_lock_text,passage,""Grand Hallway Flags of silk hang high above you in this massive hallway. The ceiling easily reaches upwards of thirty feet, and the white stone gives the passage an almost pristine quality. A carpet of royal purple has been covers the floor in all directions, shimmering as if to honor your prescence."",none"
