repo,Simulator/DataSimVer/0005/RoomObjectClues.csv,398,36,"wcc_map1_room2936,1,2936,Darkwood Forest,,tree,""Darkwood Forest This gloomy, unsettling forest is beautiful in a dark sort of way. The trees are black as coal, and are very tall. Their thick, knotted branches twist every which way so that they appear to be contorted in pain, though this is surely not the case. The leaves are a dark green, and are nearly as thick as "",none"
repo,Simulator/DataSimVer/0005/RoomObjectClues.csv,431,36,"wcc_map1_room3336,1,3336,Bank Vault,key_or_lock_text,door|gate|sign,""Bank Vault This is a large iron room. The gate here is triply locked, with a large steel door leading to the south. A sign in front of the door reads """"Silvermere Vault"""". Perhaps the untold fortunes of the city elite can be found within. It would be impossible to say for any, but the most skilled in skullduggery, would "",none"
repo,Simulator/DataSimVer/0005/RoomObjectClues.csv,463,36,"wcc_map2_room2536,2,2536,Dark Alley,,wall,""Dark Alley This rancid alleyway is claustrophobic and unsettling. Trash is ankle- deep on the ground, and occasionally something squishy and wet can be felt underfoot. Bloodstains are frequent on the crumbling walls, adding a certain je-ne-sais-quoi to this fine place. The tall stone barrier surrounding the city stands"",none"
repo,Simulator/DataSimVer/0005/RoomObjectClues.csv,528,36,"wcc_map6_room136,6,136,Swampside Path,special_text,path|pool,""Swampside Path Mud and trodden grass form the packed surface of this winding path. It skirts around the southern edge of the swamp, far enough from it as to be safe, but not far enough to escape the foul odour. The swamp lies in a bowl-like depression, but here it is impossible to enter due to dense, thorny vegetation "",none"
repo,Simulator/DataSimVer/0005/RoomObjectClues.csv,532,36,"wcc_map6_room236,6,236,Swampside Path,special_text,path|pool,""Swampside Path Mud and trodden grass form the packed surface of this winding path. It skirts around the northern edge of the swamp, far enough from it as to be safe, but not far enough to escape the foul odour. The swamp lies in a bowl-like depression, but here it is impossible to enter due to dense, thorny vegetation "",none"
repo,Simulator/DataSimVer/0005/RoomObjectClues.csv,587,36,"wcc_map6_room636,6,636,Gnome Village,,path|well,Gnome Village This packed-earth path winds its way between the wood and stone buildings on the gnomish village. It appears to be well-used but also well-kept.,none"
repo,Simulator/DataSimVer/0005/RoomObjectClues.csv,657,36,"wcc_map6_room1336,6,1336,Axe of Fury Weapon Store,,wall,""Axe of Fury Weapon Store This odd store is somewhat different than most weapon shops, in that is almost seems part shrine. The dwarven reverence for a good axe is exemplified here-- only the most finely crafted axes are available. Sitting in display cases, or hung on the walls, these wickedly- gleaming implements of de"",none"
repo,Simulator/DataSimVer/0005/RoomObjectClues.csv,670,36,"wcc_map6_room1361,6,1361,Ornate Passageway,key_or_lock_text,passage|statue|wall,""Ornate Passageway This wide stone passage is carpeted with a luxurious red fabric. The walls are covered in a variety of tapestries, showing ancient beasts, dwarven kings, and epic battles with a variety of foes. Here and there a statue of an armoured dwarf stands like a sentry. A large archway leads out to the east, a"",none"
repo,Simulator/DataSimVer/0005/RoomObjectClues.csv,671,36,"wcc_map6_room1362,6,1362,""Ornate Passageway, Stairwell"",key_or_lock_text,passage|statue|wall,""Ornate Passageway, Stairwell This wide stone passage is carpeted with a luxurious red fabric. The walls are covered in a variety of tapestries, showing ancient beasts, dwarven kings, and epic battles with a variety of foes. Here and there a statue of an armoured dwarf stands like a sentry. At the end of the corridor, a"",none"
repo,Simulator/DataSimVer/0005/RoomObjectClues.csv,794,36,"wcc_map12_room36,12,36,Canvas Tent,,wall|chest,""Canvas Tent Although quite small by normal living standards, all available space in this cleverly-made home is used efficiently. Thick, hollow poles form the framework for the tent, while the cloth is sturdy and tear- resistant. A small firepit, currently extinguished, is set in the centre of the floor, and a sleeping "",none"
repo,Simulator/DataSimVer/0005/RoomObjectClues.csv,836,36,"wcc_map16_room336,16,336,Barracks,,wall,Barracks Neatly made beds line the walls here. Slaves scurry around the room picking up clutter and repairing weapons or armour. Amazon warriors filter about bragging and showing off their latest spoils of war.,none"
repo,Simulator/DataSimVer/0005/RoomObjectClues.csv,838,36,"wcc_map16_room360,16,360,Elder's Path,,path|well,""Elder's Path A well-worn path leads around the council of elder's chambers. Crafted benches lean against the sides of the building, and sweet smelling flowers blossom on the side of each one."",none"
