repo,Simulator/DataSimVer/0005/RoomObjectClues.csv,920,36,"wcc_map17_room636,17,636,""Blackwood Forest, Winding Trail"",,tree,""Blackwood Forest, Winding Trail This trail leads through a dark forest, thick with trees and brush. Snow weighs down the branches and occasionally falls in clumps to the ground as the wind shifts. There is an abnormal chill that reaches deep into your bones as you travel through here. Despite the snow, a faint stench"",none"
repo,Simulator/DataSimVer/0005/RoomObjectClues.csv,963,36,"wcc_map17_room2436,17,2436,Jandar's Missile Weapons,key_or_lock_text,,""Jandar's Missile Weapons Unstrung bows hang about the shop for you to look at and handle. Some are of an obviously better quality than others, and some are barely passable as useable. The local guild will tell you that bows, like the many other forms of commerce, have come into a shortage the past with the troubles c"",none"
repo,Simulator/DataSimVer/0005/RoomObjectClues.csv,978,3000,"wcc_map17_room3000,17,3000,Grand Hallway,key_or_lock_text,passage,""Grand Hallway Flags of silk hang high above you in this massive hallway. The ceiling easily reaches upwards of thirty feet, and the white stone gives the passage an almost pristine quality. A carpet of royal purple has been covers the floor in all directions, shimmering as if to honor your prescence."",none"
repo,Simulator/DataSimVer/0005/RoomObjectClues.csv,985,36,"wcc_map17_room3036,17,3036,Shadowy Passage,key_or_lock_text|special_text,door|passage|path,""Shadowy Passage Pitchblack stones encase you in this passageway, giving you a feeling of great unease. The rock seems to lash out at any form of light that is found, and most chilling of all the passage is silent like that of a coffin. Large black doors stand in your path, as if challenging you to dare open them, unlea"",none"
