mmud_explorer,CLAUDE.md,19,36,"- Dependencies (must be registered on the build machine): DAO 3.6 (`Dao360.dll`), Microsoft"
mmud_explorer,CLAUDE.md,52,1.5,"  the bottom. `frmMain.frm` is ~1.5 MB — read targeted ranges, not the whole file."
mmud_explorer,CLAUDE.md,73,regen,"GreaterMUD/Paramud branch and which data-version threshold gates it. Two recovery facts that affect any regen/rest formula: `nCharHPRegen` is handled in *resting-rate* form (already x3, so passive HP = HPRegen/3 per 30s, rest = HPRegen per 20s), and a character can rest (HP) **or** meditate (MP) but never both and never in combat (passive always ticks)."
