mmud_explorer,docs/exp-per-hour-models.md,43,regen,- **`nCharHPRegen` arrives in _resting-rate_ form (already game-value x3).** So
mmud_explorer,docs/exp-per-hour-models.md,44,regen,  passive HP = `HPRegen/3` per 30s; rest HP = `HPRegen` per 20s. Mana
mmud_explorer,docs/exp-per-hour-models.md,45,regen,"  (`nCharMPRegen`, `nMeditateRate`) is passed as-is."
mmud_explorer,docs/exp-per-hour-models.md,50,regen,  then divided by `avgAlive = (nMaxRegen+1)/(2*nMaxRegen)`. Model D reverses this
mmud_explorer,docs/exp-per-hour-models.md,52,regen,"- Tick constants: round 5s, rest 20s, regen 30s, meditate 10s. Mob HP-regen"
mmud_explorer,docs/exp-per-hour-models.md,53,regen,"  cadence: `STOCK_MOB_HPREGEN_ROUNDS=18`, `GMUD_MOB_HPREGEN_ROUNDS=6`"
mmud_explorer,docs/exp-per-hour-models.md,68,3.0,"  B ~13.8%, C ~16.5%. (Signed bias: A -2.1%, D +3.0%, B +12.6%, C +13.3%.)"
